{"display":"[Pasted text #1 +6 lines]","pastedContents":{"1":{"id":1,"type":"text","content":"The admitted-filler used by rewrite /check_width /apply_psis /= — the same closing pattern as\n  check_fact3_true. If it fails, the fix is to replace the boolean reflection proofs with direct structural\n   proofs by mmtree induction. I already worked out the arithmetic:\n  - cde_total_width_phi_w: j.-1 + 2 + (n-j-1).-1 = n-1 at the inductive step\n  - D_offsets_phi_w_eq_S_w_seq: decompose D_offsets and S_w_seq at mm_pos, use IH on subtrees\n\n  These structural proofs avoid vm_compute entirely — longer (~100 LOC each) but memory-safe."}},"timestamp":1777064461771,"project":"/scratch/lelarge/mathcomp-eulerian","sessionId":"55f0839d-14c6-45f5-8ac3-a206e1d5f957"}
